1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,190
Football Intelligence Platform is an AI
football analytics project for Europe's top
five leagues.

2
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:13,000
This is version 2.6.3, recorded on the
twenty-second of October 2026.

3
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:22,170
Twenty-six seasons of results feed Drishti,
the XGBoost match model, with SHAP
explanations and a goals model.

4
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:29,100
One FastAPI backend serves the Android app
and a grounded assistant on Cloudflare
Workers AI.

5
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:36,690
The app is invite-only. A friend redeems a
one-time code and chooses a password.

6
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:41,790
Then they accept a short notice that says
exactly what the server records.

7
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:48,730
My Team follows a favourite club, now saved
to the account so it survives a reinstall.

8
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:55,180
It shows the next match, the pick and why,
with win, draw and loss on one bar.

9
00:00:55,530 --> 00:01:00,330
The season outlook opens a projected table,
with your team highlighted.

10
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:07,360
Fixtures cover all five leagues, refreshed
every day, with your team's match marked.

11
00:01:07,710 --> 00:01:12,340
A prediction shows the chances and the
likeliest scores from the goals model.

12
00:01:13,590 --> 00:01:20,170
Explain turns the SHAP values into the
factors for and against the pick, in plain
football language.

13
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:28,640
The assistant now knows your favourite team.
Ask where my team will finish, and it
answers for Arsenal.

14
00:01:28,990 --> 00:01:34,770
It also remembers the conversation, so they,
and their, follow on from the questions
before.

15
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:41,100
The numbers come from the same tools as the
app: second place, and a one-in-three title
chance.

16
00:01:41,450 --> 00:01:47,550
A daily token budget keeps the cost in
check, shown as about how many questions are
left today.

17
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:54,970
The prediction model has a name now,
Drishti, with its version and season metrics
in Settings.

18
00:01:56,220 --> 00:02:04,240
Behind it all is one documented FastAPI
service, with accounts, saved favourites,
the assistant and health probes.

19
00:02:05,490 --> 00:02:13,770
Every chat writes structured log events: the
tool it called, the model, the tokens, the
cost, and how many earlier turns it carried.

20
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:20,160
It runs on a laptop with one command, and on
Cloud Run for the staging app.
